-- ownership (project): a constructor field past 64 in a summary block
-- (issue #289, `ownership-checker.md` §28.4). `push` writes field 64 of
-- `Wide`, so its summary names that field, and the block that carries it
-- across the module boundary must name it. Before the fix the step was
-- `c * 64 + 64`, the id of a constructor that does not exist, and writing
-- the block crashed the `check` that wrote cache entries.
pub type Wide
    = Wide
        Int
        Int
        Int
